OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy's self-harm threat not
OL,4,Apassed on - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fthat some may find disturbing.
OL,9,FThe Metropolitan Police did not tell
OL,10,Fanother force a former Royal Marine
OL,11,Flater found dead had said he would harm
OL,12,Fhimself after leaving custody, an
OL,13,Finquest heard.
OL,15,FMatthew Trickett, 37, had appeared in
OL,16,Fcourt charged under the National
OL,17,FSecurity Act and was found in a park in
OL,18,FMaidenhead on 19 May 2024.
