OL,3,GNEWSAAlleged spy's self-harm threat not
OL,4,Apassed on - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fassisting the Hong Kong intelligence
OL,8,Fservice he was seen to attempt
OL,9,Fself-harm in his cell on 11 May. He was
OL,10,Freleased on bail on 13 May.
